    "show_share": true,
    "description": "A new project by the Institute for Educational Development, East Africa (IED, EA) in collaboration with the Aga Khan Foundation has officially kicked off. The Foundations for Learning (F4L) project is funded by Global Affairs Canada and the Aga Khan Foundation Canada.",
